\end_layout

\end_inset

 and kernel mount state files (
\begin_inset Flex Code
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
proc_pid_mounts(5)
\end_layout

\end_inset

 and friends) and provides a simple 
\nospellcheck on
one-shot
\nospellcheck default
 mount/unmount interface to users and the rest of the code base.
\end_layout

