\begin_layout Section
That Time I Literally Forgot to Use The Tool I Just Wrote
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
After implementing the 
\begin_inset Flex Emph
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
plugin priorities 
\end_layout

\end_inset

scheme I was alarmed to observe a 7% coverage regression when running the unit and integration test suite.
 This is a substantial drop in coverage,
 and it was almost entirely confined to the 
\begin_inset Flex Code
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
lvm2-thin
\end_layout

\end_inset

 plugin.
 Curious.
 After some debugging,
 head scratching,
 additional coffee,
 and rude words,
 I realised that the problem was not a 
\begin_inset Flex Emph
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
code
\end_layout

\end_inset

 regression,
 but rather a 
\begin_inset Flex Emph
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
configuration
\end_layout

\end_inset

 regression caused by changes I had made in 
\begin_inset Flex Code
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
/etc/snapm/plugins.d
\end_layout

\end_inset

 in order to test out the new facility manually:
\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset


\end_layout

