noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

 for further discussion of this important topic.
\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset


\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset


\begin_inset Flex Strong
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
Q:
\end_layout

\end_inset

 What level of consistency do snapshots provide?
\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset


