\begin_layout Plain Layout
Q:
\end_layout

\end_inset

 Can snapshots protect against hardware failure?
\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset


\begin_inset Flex Strong
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
A:
\end_layout

\end_inset

 Snapshots live on the same storage as your data.
 A catastrophic hardware failure may affect both your main volumes and your snapshots.
 For this reason we always recommend combining 
\begin_inset Flex Code
