 snapshots.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Subsection
User Story:
 Service Consistency
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
As a system administrator I want to control what services are stopped before snapshot set creation,
 and restarted afterwards.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Allow the user to configure a set of services to be halted when creating snapshot sets and restarted afterwards.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Develop mechanisms to gracefully stop and start services around snapshot set transactions and report or interrupt the operation in case of error.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Subsection
User Story:
 Application Consistency
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
As a system administrator,
 I want fine grained and automatic application coordination during snapshot operations.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Develop an API for seamless integration with applications,
 allowing stopping or suspending services before snapshot creation.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Allow applications to 
